  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1149589/description_e5507e39-511a-4100-ac3a-0f70315e5ce6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"44\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>這是一個模組，旨在為遊戲增添一絲沉浸感。每次您受到傷害或對敵人造成傷害時，都會觸發流血效果、粒子特效與音效！！</strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>所有主世界、下界與終界的生物都會流血！<br></strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pi-fuXMWtxQ\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blood-n-particles-mod/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1149589/description_6e15cd86-ffcb-455a-835c-02724f12c9ef.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"67\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blood-n-particles-mod/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1149589/description_f3ae3ed6-6eb3-4c82-b50e-74563929d28b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"67\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blood-n-particles-mod/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1149589/description_1388aca9-30f6-4078-95a4-c074fb8ce049.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"67\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>如果您對該模組有任何建議或想回報錯誤，別忘了在留言區留下您的想法 :D</em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1149589/description_9541d9f5-9ac2-429a-9169-81bef38e4194.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"44\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">如果您想支持我們，可以加入我們的 &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://discord.gg/N6TsrGvzvZ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></span> 或在我們的<span style=\"color:#3598db\">&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/RenovatedStudios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></span> 上提供財務支持</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/N6TsrGvzvZ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1017834/description_f9406618-0e4f-4d0a-92da-5376ba49b9e8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"290\" height=\"67\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/RenovatedStudios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1017834/description_fb2b698d-66ca-4888-a0c3-460d706e5304.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"290\" height=\"67\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1149589/description_d41b185e-e8ef-40ec-87a9-0fcddcf5d5c3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"44\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">花兩分鐘填寫問卷，讓我們聽到您對改善 Blood N' Particles 的點子！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScGL1tjTJqI5YHImbqQb6j2MRRY5D2ueoqAplGaOckJQdYDYA/viewform\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">是的，我想幫忙！填寫問卷。</a></span></p>",
